### ⭐ Exercise 4 - Personal Profile Webpage

Created a personal profile webpage using multiple HTML attributes.

The webpage includes:

* Navigation links using `id`
* About section using `class` and `title`
* Skills with the same class name
* Contact information using `data-email` and `data-phone`
* `lang="en"`
* `tabindex`

**Concepts Used:**

* `id`
* `class`
* `title`
* `data-*`
* `lang`
* `tabindex`

